### Create account
POST http://localhost:3000/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "phuc2006@example.com",
    "password_hash": "12345",
    "full_name": "Phuc 12345",
    "role": "learner",
    "status": "active"
}

### Get all accounts
GET http://localhost:3000/accounts

###
### Assessment endpoints
### Replace these with valid JWTs for active instructor and learner accounts.
@instructorToken = replace-with-instructor-jwt
@learnerToken = replace-with-learner-jwt

### Instructor: get owned courses, lessons, and linked skills
GET http://localhost:3000/assessments/authoring-data
Authorization: Bearer {{instructorToken}}

### Instructor: publish a four-option lesson quiz
POST http://localhost:3000/assessments
Authorization: Bearer {{instructorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Lesson 1 quiz",
  "course_id": "1",
  "lesson_id": "1",
  "time_limit_seconds": 1800,
  "max_attempts": 3,
  "passing_percent": 70,
  "questions": [
    {
      "prompt": "Choose the correct answer.",
      "skill_id": "1",
      "options": [
        { "text": "Option A", "is_correct": true },
        { "text": "Option B", "is_correct": false },
        { "text": "Option C", "is_correct": false },
        { "text": "Option D", "is_correct": false }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

### Learner: list published quizzes in active enrollments
GET http://localhost:3000/assessments
Authorization: Bearer {{learnerToken}}

### Learner: start/resume attempt
POST http://localhost:3000/assessments/1/attempts
Authorization: Bearer {{learnerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Learner: save an answer and submit
PUT http://localhost:3000/assessments/attempts/1/answers
Authorization: Bearer {{learnerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "answers": [
    { "attempt_question_id": "1", "selected_option_id": "1" }
  ]
}

###
POST http://localhost:3000/assessments/attempts/1/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{learnerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Learner: inspect attempt history and answer-by-answer result
GET http://localhost:3000/assessments/attempts/history
Authorization: Bearer {{learnerToken}}

###
GET http://localhost:3000/assessments/attempts/1/result
Authorization: Bearer {{learnerToken}}